{"4803870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OctoDock: Cozy & Chill", "steam_appid": 4803870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/95a0b6b4701c5356bdc3c413926c83cd.avif?t=1782466028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras_big/95a0b6b4701c5356bdc3c413926c83cd.avif?t=1782466028 width=1560 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Breathe in sea breeze, wait for incoming ships🍃</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fluffy giant octopus guards the seaside dock! Leave all your fatigue and worries behind, and start your cozy idle management adventure✨ Listen to soothing crashing ocean waves🌊, watch story-laden fishing boats drift into harbor with the wind as sailors stroll ashore. Manage rows of seaside stalls stocked with soda, pastries and tropical snacks to greet every wandering traveler warmly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/6d7c4c2fc787d55d016930ab4d8dd4dc.poster.avif?t=1782466028\" width=800 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/6d7c4c2fc787d55d016930ab4d8dd4dc.webm?t=1782466028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/6d7c4c2fc787d55d016930ab4d8dd4dc.mp4?t=1782466028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to panic over trivial chores—take things easy! Play casual mini-games whenever you like to earn extra resources and gold, laid-back gameplay at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tense grind, no rushed schedules (´▽`ʃ♡ƪ)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/eff607ac051168a781ff76475c9a9be9.avif?t=1782466028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras_big/eff607ac051168a781ff76475c9a9be9.avif?t=1782466028 width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐙 Laid-back Idle Gameplay | Zero Stress AFK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to stay online nonstop. Let your shops run smoothly automatically, come back anytime to check newly docked vessels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍤 Cute Art Style, Soothing Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chubby cartoon island artwork with turquoise sea docks and adorable visiting customers</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛒 Fun Sandbox Management &amp; Free Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your exclusive coastal shopping street from scratch and craft your one-of-a-kind octopus harbor step by step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Relaxing Mini Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of casual mini games to clear stages and gain bonus supplies &amp; gold, filling your dock life with lovely surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌬️ Immersive Seaside Vibe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by sea wind, rolling waves, returning boats and cute companions, unwind in a slow-paced coastal paradise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Escape your busy routine, spend a warm endless summer at OctoDock🌞<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/389bba408ecfb1e9b18d7d66d0612d23.poster.avif?t=1782466028\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4803870/extras/389bba408ecfb1e9b18d7d66d0612d23.webm?t=1782466028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a